{"n":114,"name":"الناس","nameEn":"An-Nas","meaning":"Mankind","revealed":"Makkah","ayahs":6,"translation":"Abdullah Yusuf Ali","verses":[{"n":1,"ar":"قُلۡ اَعُوۡذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِۙ‏","en":"Say: I seek refuge with the Lord and Cherisher of Mankind"},{"n":2,"ar":"مَلِكِ النَّاسِۙ‏","en":"The King (or Ruler) of Mankind"},{"n":3,"ar":"اِلٰهِ النَّاسِۙ‏","en":"The god (or judge) of Mankind"},{"n":4,"ar":"مِنۡ شَرِّ الۡوَسۡوَاسِ ࣢ۙ الۡخَنَّاسِۙ‏","en":"From the mischief of the Whisperer (of Evil), who withdraws (after his whisper)"},{"n":5,"ar":"الَّذِيۡ يُوَسۡوِسُ فِيۡ صُدُوۡرِ النَّاسِۙ‏","en":"(The same) who whispers into the hearts of Mankind"},{"n":6,"ar":"مِنَ الۡجِنَّةِ وَالنَّاسِࣖ‏","en":"Among Jinns and among men"}]}